# 1. PROJECT UNDERSTANDING SUMMARY

Your project is an advanced end-to-end Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) system built from scratch with custom ingestion, chunking, hybrid retrieval, reranking, context engineering, generation, and evaluation capabilities. 

---

## Project Goal

The goal of the project is to build a production-style RAG pipeline capable of:

* ingesting heterogeneous documents
* chunking them intelligently
* storing embeddings in a vector database
* retrieving highly relevant context
* reranking retrieved results
* generating grounded answers using LLMs
* evaluating answer quality using RAGAS

This is significantly beyond a basic “LangChain tutorial chatbot.”

---

## Core Problem Solved

LLMs hallucinate because:

* they lack external knowledge
* they cannot access proprietary documents
* they have stale training data

Your system solves this by:

1. retrieving relevant knowledge dynamically
2. grounding generation in retrieved context
3. improving retrieval quality using hybrid search + reranking
4. optimizing context before generation

