# 4. POSSIBLE INTERVIEW QUESTIONS & ANSWERS

# Q: Why hybrid retrieval instead of vector search alone?

Strong answer:
“Dense retrieval captures semantic meaning well but may miss exact lexical matches. BM25 captures keyword relevance strongly but lacks semantic understanding. Combining both with Weighted RRF improved overall retrieval robustness.”

Weak answer:
“Because tutorials said so.”

---

# Q: Why use reranking?

Strong answer:
“Initial retrieval produces candidate documents but scores are often noisy. Cross-encoder reranking performs deeper query-document interaction and significantly improves final ranking precision.”

---

