# 5. MOCK INTERVIEW MODE

# Senior Engineer Question

“How does Weighted RRF help compared to directly averaging scores?”

Ideal answer:
“Dense retrieval and BM25 scores exist on different distributions and scales. Averaging raw scores can bias one retrieval system. RRF instead combines rankings rather than scores, making fusion more stable and retrieval-model agnostic.”

